enshot00005.png", "id": "2823516081338579", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620432_2823516084671912_1830329240108999289_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ruNNo8pBjkYQ7kNvwHGhyPH&_nc_oc=AdrY3b6mZZ0izorwO4H9uXvABtzSNyjDQiCgSHoy3zn68iCJQhtII6fw4H0xFGr-jug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTdaFc5MaajJvMtBgzehp1khL56TrdGGSjTlodMyhifsg&oe=6AF5D0EC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Diagnosing and Replacing Sequencers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Diagnosing and Replacing Sequencers is an immersive VR training application developed as part of the Immerse Learn Diagnosing and Replacing Sequencers micro-credential program. This application provides learners with realistic, hands-on practice in identifying faulty sequencers, diagnosing HVAC system issues, performing replacement procedures, and understanding proper system operation in a simulated training environment.\n\nDesigned to enhance technical skills through experiential learning, this VR simulation allows learners to safely practice real-world troubleshooting procedures while building confidence and competency. Access to this application is exclusively available to individuals enrolled in the Immerse Learn micro-credential program and is intended solely for guided hands-on training as part of the certification pathway.", "short_description": "Diagnosing and Replacing Sequencers is a VR training application designed exclusively for learners enrolled in the Immerse Learn Diagnosing and Replacing Sequencers micro-credential program. This immersive hands-on simulation helps learners practice real-world HVAC troubleshooting and sequencer replacement procedures in a safe virtual environment. Access is restricted to enrolled program participants only."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "pub